#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/developer_api.html:7
msgid ""
"The HTTP API under /api/ matches the explorer. Responses are JSON with an ok "
"field when the call succeeds."
msgstr ""
"API ya HTTP chini ya /api/ inalingana na mgunduzi. Majibu ni JSON yenye uga "
"sawa wakati simu itafaulu."

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/developer_api.html:11
msgid "Amounts and precision"
msgstr "Kiasi na usahihi"

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/developer_api.html:12
msgid ""
"All money fields use whole numbers in satoshis. One TAN is one hundred "
"million satoshis. Do not use float types for money in your code."
msgstr ""
"Sehemu zote za pesa hutumia nambari nzima katika satoshis. TAN moja ni "
"satoshi milioni mia moja. Usitumie aina za kuelea kupata pesa kwenye msimbo "
"wako."

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/developer_api.html:15
msgid "Read-only endpoints"
msgstr "Vipimo vya kusoma pekee"

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/developer_api.html:17
msgid "height, tip, mempool count, reference price, difficulty"
msgstr "urefu, ncha, hesabu ya kumbukumbu, bei ya kumbukumbu, ugumu"

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/developer_api.html:18
msgid "recent blocks as JSON"
msgstr "kuzuia hivi karibuni kama JSON"

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/developer_api.html:19
msgid "one block with transactions"
msgstr "block moja na shughuli"

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/developer_api.html:20
msgid "transaction plus confirmed flag"
msgstr "shughuli pamoja na bendera iliyothibitishwa"

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/developer_api.html:21
msgid "spendable outputs for an address"
msgstr "matokeo yanayoweza kutumika kwa anwani"

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/developer_api.html:22
msgid "pending transactions"
msgstr "shughuli zinazosubiri"

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/developer_api.html:23
msgid "deployed contracts list"
msgstr "orodha ya mikataba iliyotumwa"

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/developer_api.html:26
msgid "Write endpoints (POST)"
msgstr "Andika vidokezo (POST)"

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/developer_api.html:27
msgid ""
"Submitting transactions and mining changes local data. In production, add "
"authentication, rate limits, and network rules."
msgstr ""
"Kuwasilisha miamala na uchimbaji madini hubadilisha data ya ndani. Katika "
"uzalishaji, ongeza uthibitishaji, viwango vya viwango na sheria za mtandao."

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/developer_api.html:29
msgid "body includes transaction object"
msgstr "mwili ni pamoja na kitu cha muamala"

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/developer_api.html:30
msgid "optional miner_wif for who receives fees"
msgstr "hiari mchimbaji_wif kwa anayepokea ada"

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/developer_api.html:31
msgid "set reference_price_usd"
msgstr "weka rejeleo_bei_usd"

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/developer_api.html:32
msgid "deployer_wif, fee_satoshis, bytecode_hex"
msgstr "deployer_wif, ada_satoshis, bytecode_hex"

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/developer_api.html:33
msgid "caller_wif, contract_id_hex, calldata_hex, fee_satoshis"
msgstr "caller_wif, contract_id_hex, calldata_hex, ada_satoshis"

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/developer_api.html:35
msgid ""
"POST routes use csrf_exempt for simple JSON tools. Real browser apps should "
"send CSRF tokens or hide writes behind your own backend."
msgstr ""
"Njia za POST hutumia csrf_exempt kwa zana rahisi za JSON. Programu za "
"kivinjari halisi zinapaswa kutuma tokeni za CSRF au kuficha maandishi nyuma "
"yako mwenyewe."

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/developer_api.html:37
msgid "Python integration"
msgstr "Ujumuishaji wa Python"

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/developer_api.html:38
msgid ""
"Inside the same Django project you can import chain_api.services.node and "
"call get_chain() without HTTP. Remote services should use HTTPS and the JSON "
"API."
msgstr ""
"Ndani ya mradi huo wa Django unaweza kuingiza chain_api.services.node na "
"kupiga simu get_chain() bila HTTP. Huduma za mbali zinapaswa kutumia HTTPS "
"na API ya JSON."

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/developer_api.html:40
msgid "Errors"
msgstr "Makosa"

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/developer_api.html:41
msgid ""
"Errors return HTTP 4xx with ok false and an error string you can show to "
"users."
msgstr ""
"Hitilafu hurejesha HTTP 4xx ikiwa ok sivyo na mfuatano wa hitilafu unayoweza "
"kuwaonyesha watumiaji."

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/features_architecture.html:5
msgid "Features and architecture"
msgstr "Vipengele na usanifu"

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/features_architecture.html:7
msgid ""
"The code is split so the chain core, HTTP API, and web front can evolve on "
"their own."
msgstr ""
"Nambari imegawanywa ili msingi wa mnyororo, API ya HTTP, na mbele ya wavuti "
"ziweze kubadilika zenyewe."

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/features_architecture.html:11
msgid "Main packages"
msgstr "Vifurushi kuu"

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/features_architecture.html:13
msgid "tancoin_core: pure Python chain and TVM. No Django import."
msgstr ""
"tancoin_core: mnyororo safi wa Python na TVM. Hakuna uagizaji wa Django."

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/features_architecture.html:14
msgid "chain_api: JSON under /api/ and on-disk chain state."
msgstr "chain_api: JSON chini ya /api/ na hali ya mnyororo kwenye diski."

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/features_architecture.html:15
msgid "frontend.common: shared layout."
msgstr "frontend.common: mpangilio wa pamoja."

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/features_architecture.html:16
msgid "frontend.explorer: block explorer pages."
msgstr "frontend.explorer: zuia kurasa za wachunguzi."

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/features_architecture.html:17
msgid "frontend.documentation: these guides."
msgstr "frontend.documentation: miongozo hii."

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/features_architecture.html:18
msgid "frontend.wallet_gui: wallet web UI."
msgstr "frontend.wallet_gui: kiolesura cha wavuti wa mkoba."

