#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/features_architecture.html:38
msgid "Static files"
msgstr "Faili tuli"

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/features_architecture.html:39
msgid ""
"CSS and JavaScript live under frontend/static. In production run "
"collectstatic and serve files with nginx or a CDN."
msgstr ""
"CSS na JavaScript huishi chini ya sehemu ya mbele/tuli. Katika uzalishaji "
"endesha kukusanya tuli na utumie faili na nginx au CDN."

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/features_architecture.html:41
msgid "Extending"
msgstr "Kupanua"

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/features_architecture.html:42
msgid ""
"Add new apps under frontend for new screens. Keep chain rules inside "
"tancoin_core or the node service instead of copying logic in views."
msgstr ""
"Ongeza programu mpya chini ya sehemu ya mbele kwa skrini mpya. Weka sheria "
"za mnyororo ndani ya tancoin_core au huduma ya nodi badala ya kunakili "
"mantiki katika maoni."

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/hub.html:22
msgid ""
"Guides for users, operators, and developers who work with the Tancoin node, "
"explorer, and smart contracts."
msgstr ""
"Miongozo kwa watumiaji, waendeshaji, na wasanidi wanaofanya kazi na nodi ya "
"Tancoin, kichunguzi na kandarasi mahiri."

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/hub.html:23
msgid ""
"Choose a topic below. Each page uses only the language you selected in the "
"menu."
msgstr ""
"Chagua mada hapa chini. Kila ukurasa hutumia tu lugha uliyochagua kwenye "
"menyu."

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/hub.html:37
msgid ""
"Image-led tour of wallet, payments, mining, explorer, and API with links "
"into the full guides."
msgstr ""
"Ziara kwa picha kuhusu pochi, malipo, uchimbaji, kichunguzi na API pamoja na "
"viungo hadi miongozo kamili."

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/hub.html:48
msgid ""
"Create keys, check balance, send TAN, and use the test faucet when debug "
"mode is on."
msgstr ""
"Unda funguo, angalia salio, tuma TAN, na utumie bomba la majaribio wakati "
"hali ya utatuzi imewashwa."

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/hub.html:59
msgid "Short guide to sending coins, mining a block, and managing keys."
msgstr ""
"Mwongozo mfupi wa kutuma sarafu, kuchimba kizuizi na funguo za kudhibiti."

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/hub.html:70
msgid "Full walkthrough: wallet, payment, miner role, and examples."
msgstr "Mapitio kamili: pochi, malipo, jukumu la mchimbaji na mifano."

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/hub.html:81
msgid "Explorer, mempool, confirmed blocks, and the reference price field."
msgstr ""
"Explorer, mempool, vitalu vilivyothibitishwa, na uga wa bei ya marejeleo."

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/hub.html:92
msgid "JSON routes, bodies, errors, and how to call them from other apps."
msgstr ""
"Njia za JSON, miili, hitilafu, na jinsi ya kuzipigia simu kutoka kwa "
"programu zingine."

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/hub.html:103
msgid "TVM model, deploy and call flow, and how it differs from Ethereum."
msgstr ""
"Mfano wa TVM, peleka na mtiririko wa simu, na jinsi inavyotofautiana na "
"Ethereum."

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/hub.html:114
msgid ""
"Programs vs files, full-service and signing-only setups, HD keys, BIP39, and "
"how they relate to the explorer."
msgstr ""
"Programu dhidi ya faili, usanidi wa huduma kamili na saini pekee, funguo za "
"HD, BIP39, na jinsi zinavyohusiana na mchunguzi."

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/hub.html:125
msgid "Keys, WIF storage, genesis wallet, CSRF, and production checklist."
msgstr ""
"Funguo, hifadhi ya WIF, pochi ya mwanzo, CSRF, na orodha ya ukaguzi wa "
"uzalishaji."

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/hub.html:136
msgid "What the software includes and how the packages fit together."
msgstr "Programu inajumuisha nini na jinsi vifurushi vinavyolingana."

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/hub.html:147
msgid "One-page table of HTTP methods and paths."
msgstr "Jedwali la ukurasa mmoja la mbinu na njia za HTTP."

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/smart_contracts.html:5
msgid "Smart contracts (TVM)"
msgstr "Mikataba mahiri (TVM)"

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/smart_contracts.html:7
msgid ""
"Tancoin uses UTXO for the coin, like Bitcoin. Contracts add stored bytecode "
"and storage, run by the Tancoin Virtual Machine (TVM)."
msgstr ""
"Tancoin hutumia UTXO kwa sarafu, kama Bitcoin. Mikataba huongeza bytecode na "
"hifadhi iliyohifadhiwa, inayoendeshwa na Tancoin Virtual Machine (TVM)."

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/smart_contracts.html:11
msgid "Not the same as Ethereum EVM"
msgstr "Sio sawa na Ethereum EVM"

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/smart_contracts.html:12
msgid ""
"TVM bytecode is not compatible with Solidity. You cannot paste Ethereum "
"compiler output here. The goal is a small, clear machine you can read and "
"extend."
msgstr ""
"TVM bytecode haioani na Solidity. Huwezi kubandika pato la mkusanyaji wa "
"Ethereum hapa. Lengo ni mashine ndogo, wazi unaweza kusoma na kupanua."

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/smart_contracts.html:14
msgid "Deploy and call"
msgstr "Sambaza na piga simu"

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/smart_contracts.html:16
msgid ""
"Deploy: an output of type contract_deploy carries bytecode in payload. After "
"the block is applied, the contract id is derived from the transaction id and "
"output index."
msgstr ""
"Tumia: matokeo ya aina contract_deploy hubeba bytecode katika upakiaji. "
"Baada ya kizuizi kutumika, kitambulisho cha mkataba kinatokana na "
"kitambulisho cha muamala na faharasa ya matokeo."

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/smart_contracts.html:17
msgid ""
"Call: a contract_call output points at that id and passes calldata. The VM "
"runs when the block is applied and may update storage."
msgstr ""
"Simu: contract_call pato pointi katika kitambulisho hicho na kupitisha "
"calldata. VM hutumika wakati kizuizi kinatumika na inaweza kusasisha hifadhi."

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/smart_contracts.html:18
msgid ""
"Fees: many contract outputs have value zero. The miner still collects fees "
"from the difference between inputs and outputs, like normal transfers."
msgstr ""
"Ada: matokeo mengi ya mkataba yana thamani sifuri. Mchimbaji bado anakusanya "
"ada kutokana na tofauti kati ya pembejeo na matokeo, kama vile uhamisho wa "
"kawaida."

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/smart_contracts.html:21
msgid "Gas and limits"
msgstr "Gesi na mipaka"

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/smart_contracts.html:22
msgid ""
"Each opcode costs gas. Storage writes cost more. If gas runs out, the call "
"fails and storage does not stay in a half-updated state for that call."
msgstr ""
"Kila opcode inagharimu gesi. Maandishi ya kuhifadhi yanagharimu zaidi. Gesi "
"ikiisha, simu itashindwa na uhifadhi haubaki katika hali iliyosasishwa nusu "
"ya simu hiyo."

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/smart_contracts.html:24
msgid "Execution context"
msgstr "Muktadha wa utekelezaji"

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/smart_contracts.html:25
msgid ""
"Contracts can read block time from an opcode and the caller hash from the "
"first input’s public key script. This is similar in idea to msg.sender and "
"block.timestamp on Ethereum."
msgstr ""
"Mikataba inaweza kusoma muda wa kuzuia kutoka kwa msimbo na heshi ya mpigaji "
"kutoka kwa hati ya ufunguo wa kwanza wa umma wa ingizo. Hili ni wazo sawa na "
"msg.sender na block.timestamp kwenye Ethereum."

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/smart_contracts.html:27
msgid "Testing"
msgstr "Kupima"

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/smart_contracts.html:28
msgid ""
"Deploy with POST /api/contracts/deploy/, then mine a block. List contracts "
"with GET /api/contracts/. Call with POST /api/contracts/call/ and hex "
"calldata."
msgstr ""
"Sambaza na POST /api/contracts/deploy/, kisha uchimba kizuizi. Orodhesha "
"mikataba na GET /api/contracts/. Piga simu na POST /api/contracts/call/ na "
"data ya simu ya hex."

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/user_guide_payments.html:5
msgid "Payments, mining, and wallet"
msgstr "Malipo, uchimbaji madini na pochi"

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/user_guide_payments.html:7
msgid ""
"Use the wallet page for a full graphical flow. This page explains the same "
"ideas with the API and Python for people who integrate systems."
msgstr ""
"Tumia ukurasa wa pochi kwa mtiririko kamili wa picha. Ukurasa huu unaelezea "
"mawazo sawa na API na Python kwa watu wanaounganisha mifumo."

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/user_guide_payments.html:8
msgid "Open the wallet"
msgstr "Fungua mkoba"

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/user_guide_payments.html:13
msgid "Units"
msgstr "Vitengo"

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/user_guide_payments.html:13
msgid ""
"All amounts in the API are satoshis. One TAN is one hundred million satoshis."
msgstr ""
"Kiasi zote katika API ni satoshis. TAN moja ni satoshi milioni mia moja."

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/user_guide_payments.html:16
msgid "How money moves"
msgstr "Jinsi pesa inavyosonga"

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/user_guide_payments.html:17
msgid ""
"Your balance is the sum of unspent outputs that pay your address. A payment "
"spends those outputs and creates new outputs for the receiver and usually "
"change back to you. The miner fee is the difference between input total and "
"output total."
msgstr ""
"Salio lako ni jumla ya matokeo ambayo hayajatumika ambayo hulipa anwani "
"yako. Malipo hutumia matokeo hayo na kuunda matokeo mapya kwa mpokeaji na "
"kwa kawaida hubadilika kurudi kwako. Ada ya mchimbaji ni tofauti kati ya "
"jumla ya pembejeo na jumla ya pato."

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/user_guide_payments.html:21
msgid "Wallet: create, store, restore"
msgstr "Mkoba: kuunda, kuhifadhi, kurejesha"

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/user_guide_payments.html:22
msgid "Create"
msgstr "Unda"

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/user_guide_payments.html:24
msgid ""
"The response includes address and wif. The wif is a full spend secret. Store "
"it encrypted."
msgstr ""
"Jibu ni pamoja na anwani na wif. Wifi ni siri kamili ya matumizi. Hifadhi "
"kwa njia fiche."

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/user_guide_payments.html:25
msgid "Restore in Python"
msgstr "Rejesha katika Python"

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/user_guide_payments.html:29
#: frontend/wallet_gui/templates/wallet_gui/app.html:284
msgid "Balance"
msgstr "Mizani"

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/user_guide_payments.html:31
msgid "Explorer: open /address/your_address/"
msgstr "Kichunguzi: fungua /anwani/anwani_yako/"

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/user_guide_payments.html:32
msgid "API: GET /api/chain/utxo/your_address/"
msgstr "API: PATA /api/chain/utxo/your_address/"

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/user_guide_payments.html:35
msgid "Making a payment"
msgstr "Kufanya malipo"

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/user_guide_payments.html:36
msgid "Signing is implemented in Python today. Typical steps:"
msgstr "Utiaji saini unatekelezwa katika Python leo. Hatua za kawaida:"

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/user_guide_payments.html:38
msgid "Confirm the sender has UTXOs on chain."
msgstr "Thibitisha kuwa mtumaji ana UTXO kwenye mnyororo."

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/user_guide_payments.html:39
msgid "Pick inputs that cover amount plus fee."
msgstr "Chagua pembejeo zinazofunika kiasi pamoja na ada."

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/user_guide_payments.html:40
msgid "Call Chain.create_transfer then POST /api/chain/tx/submit/."
msgstr "Piga simu Chain.create_transfer kisha POST /api/chain/tx/submit/."

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/user_guide_payments.html:41
msgid "Run POST /api/chain/mine/ or wait for a miner."
msgstr "Endesha POST /api/chain/mine/ au subiri mchimbaji."

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/user_guide_payments.html:43
msgid "Django shell example"
msgstr "Mfano wa ganda la Django"

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/user_guide_payments.html:70
msgid ""
"After mining, Bob sees a new output. Alice receives change as a new output."
msgstr ""
"Baada ya uchimbaji madini, Bob anaona pato jipya. Alice anapokea mabadiliko "
"kama pato jipya."

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/user_guide_payments.html:72
#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/visual_guide.html:65
msgid "Mining"
msgstr "Uchimbaji madini"

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/user_guide_payments.html:73
msgid ""
"Mining does not run in the background here. Whoever POSTs to /api/chain/"
"mine/ builds the block, does proof of work, and clears the mempool."
msgstr ""
"Uchimbaji madini haufanyiki chinichini hapa. Yeyote anayetuma /api/chain/"
"mine/ anajenga kizuizi, anathibitisha kazi, na kufuta kumbukumbu."

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/user_guide_payments.html:77
msgid ""
"You may omit the body in local demos so fees go to the genesis wallet. Lock "
"this down in production."
msgstr ""
"Unaweza kuacha mwili katika onyesho za karibu ili ada ziende kwenye mfuko wa "
"genesis. Funga hii katika uzalishaji."

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/user_guide_payments.html:79
msgid "Day to day"
msgstr "Siku hadi siku"

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/user_guide_payments.html:81
msgid "Receive: share your address."
msgstr "Pokea: shiriki anwani yako."

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/user_guide_payments.html:82
msgid "Send: never type a WIF on a site you do not trust."
msgstr "Tuma: usiwahi kuandika WIF kwenye tovuti ambayo huiamini."

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/user_guide_payments.html:83
msgid "Backup: keep encrypted copies of keys and data folder."
msgstr "Hifadhi nakala: weka nakala zilizosimbwa za funguo na folda ya data."

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/user_guide_payments.html:84
msgid "Many wallets: generate as many keys as you need."
msgstr "Pochi nyingi: toa funguo nyingi kadri unavyohitaji."

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/user_guide_payments.html:87
msgid "Flow diagram"
msgstr "Mchoro wa mtiririko"

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/user_guide_payments.html:91
msgid "See also"
msgstr "Tazama pia"

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/using_system.html:7
msgid ""
"This chapter is for anyone who uses the public explorer or runs a demo node. "
"You do not need programming experience for the first sections."
msgstr ""
"Sura hii ni ya mtu yeyote anayetumia kivumbuzi cha umma au anaendesha nodi "
"ya onyesho. Huhitaji matumizi ya programu kwa sehemu za kwanza."

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/using_system.html:11
msgid "What the explorer shows"
msgstr "Kile ambacho mchunguzi anaonyesha"

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/using_system.html:12
msgid ""
"The home page shows chain height, the latest block hash, mempool size, and a "
"reference price in US dollars. That price is not a live market feed. It is a "
"simple field for demos. Replace it with a real feed in production."
msgstr ""
"Ukurasa wa nyumbani unaonyesha urefu wa msururu, heshi ya hivi punde ya "
"block, saizi ya kumbukumbu, na bei ya marejeleo katika dola za Marekani. Bei "
"hiyo si mlisho wa soko la moja kwa moja. Ni uwanja rahisi kwa demos. "
"Ibadilishe na kulisha halisi katika uzalishaji."

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/using_system.html:13
msgid ""
"The blocks page lists every block from newest to oldest. Each row opens a "
"block page with all transactions inside. The first transaction in most "
"blocks is the coinbase. It has no inputs and pays the miner the reward plus "
"fees."
msgstr ""
"Ukurasa wa vizuizi huorodhesha kila kizuizi kutoka kipya hadi cha zamani "
"zaidi. Kila safu hufungua ukurasa wa kuzuia na shughuli zote ndani. Shughuli "
"ya kwanza katika vizuizi vingi ni coinbase. Haina pembejeo na hulipa "
"mchimbaji tuzo pamoja na ada."

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/using_system.html:14
msgid ""
"The transactions page lists every transaction the node knows. Mempool items "
"appear first. Confirmed items follow, newest first. Open a row to see a "
"clear flow view of inputs and outputs."
msgstr ""
"Ukurasa wa miamala huorodhesha kila shughuli ambayo nodi inajua. Vitu vya "
"Mempool vinaonekana kwanza. Vipengee vilivyoidhinishwa vinafuata, vipya "
"zaidi kwanza. Fungua safu mlalo ili kuona mwonekano wazi wa mtiririko wa "
"pembejeo na matokeo."

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/using_system.html:15
msgid ""
"The address page lists unspent outputs for that address and a simple history "
"of outputs that paid it. For full history of spends, follow links into each "
"transaction."
msgstr ""
"Ukurasa wa anwani huorodhesha matokeo ambayo hayajatumika kwa anwani hiyo na "
"historia rahisi ya matokeo ambayo yamelipa. Kwa historia kamili ya matumizi, "
"fuata viungo katika kila muamala."

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/using_system.html:17
msgid "Mempool and confirmed"
msgstr "Mempool na kuthibitishwa"

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/using_system.html:18
msgid ""
"When someone submits a signed transaction through the API, it enters the "
"mempool until a miner adds it to a block. The explorer labels these as "
"unconfirmed. After mining, they become confirmed and show a block height and "
"time."
msgstr ""
"Wakati mtu anawasilisha muamala uliotiwa saini kupitia API, huingia kwenye "
"hifadhi hadi mchimbaji aiongeze kwenye kizuizi. Mgunduzi huweka alama hizi "
"kama ambazo hazijathibitishwa. Baada ya kuchimba madini, huthibitishwa na "
"kuonyesha urefu wa block na wakati."

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/using_system.html:19
msgid ""
"On this reference node, mining is started by hand with a POST request or "
"your own script. There is no automatic global miner network unless you add "
"one."
msgstr ""
"Kwenye nodi hii ya marejeleo, uchimbaji madini unaanza kwa mkono na ombi la "
"POST au hati yako mwenyewe. Hakuna mtandao wa wachimbaji madini wa "
"kiotomatiki isipokuwa uongeze mmoja."

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/using_system.html:21
msgid "Bar chart on the home page"
msgstr "Chati ya miraba kwenye ukurasa wa nyumbani"

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/using_system.html:22
msgid ""
"The chart shows how many transactions were in each recent block. Taller bars "
"mean more activity. It uses plain CSS so it stays light and easy to audit."
msgstr ""
"Chati inaonyesha jinsi miamala mingapi ilivyokuwa katika kila kizuizi cha "
"hivi majuzi. Baa ndefu inamaanisha shughuli zaidi. Inatumia CSS ya kawaida "
"ili ibaki kuwa nyepesi na rahisi kukaguliwa."

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/using_system.html:24
msgid "For operators"
msgstr "Kwa waendeshaji"

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/using_system.html:25
msgid ""
"Chain data lives under TANCOIN_DATA_DIR, usually data/chain.json and data/"
"genesis_wallet.json. Back up this folder if you care about continuity. "
"Deleting it starts a new chain from genesis."
msgstr ""
"Data ya mnyororo huishi chini ya TANCOIN_DATA_DIR, kwa kawaida data/"
"chain.json na data/genesis_wallet.json. Hifadhi nakala ya folda hii ikiwa "
"unajali kuhusu mwendelezo. Kuifuta huanza mlolongo mpya kutoka kwa genesis."

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/visual_guide.html:9
msgid ""
"Visual overview of the main ideas. Each illustration is decorative; follow "
"the links for the full text guides. You can replace these SVG files in "
"static/img/ with high-resolution art exported from Figma."
msgstr ""
"Muhtasari wa picha wa mawazo makuu. Kila mchoro ni wa mapambo; fuata viungo "
"kwa miongozo kamili ya maandishi. Unaweza kubadilisha faili hizi za SVG "
"ndani ya static/img/ na sanaa ya ubora wa juu iliyotolewa kutoka Figma."

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/visual_guide.html:15
msgid "Full-site background"
msgstr "Mandhari ya ukurasa mzima"

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/visual_guide.html:17
msgid ""
"Every page uses a fixed ambient layer behind the header and content: a wide "
"vector scene plus the existing grid, orbs, and shine. The image slowly "
"drifts for depth; motion is reduced automatically when the browser requests "
"less animation."
msgstr ""
"Kila ukurasa hutumia safu thabiti ya mandhari nyuma ya kichwa na maudhui: "
"mandhari pana ya vekta pamoja na gridi, mduara na mwanga uliopo. Picha "
"huhamahama polepole kwa kina; harakati hupunguzwa kiotomatiki kivinjari "
"kinapo omba uhuishaji mdogo."

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/visual_guide.html:20
msgid ""
"To use a Figma export instead, save a WebP or PNG (for example 1920×1080 or "
"wider) as frontend/static/img/site-bg-ambient.webp or .png and point the img "
"src in common/base.html to that file, or swap the path in CSS if you prefer "
"a pure background-image rule."
msgstr ""
"Ili kutumia toleo la Figma badala yake, hifadhi WebP au PNG (kwa mfano "
"1920×1080 au pana zaidi) kama frontend/static/img/site-bg-ambient.webp au "
".png na uelekeze src ya img katika common/base.html kwenye faili hiyo, au "
"badilisha njia katika CSS ukipendelea sheria safi ya background-image."

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/visual_guide.html:31
msgid "Illustration: wallet device and verification motif"
msgstr "Mchoro: kifaa cha pochi na mhimili wa uthibitisho"

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/visual_guide.html:34
msgid ""
"Keys live in the wallet program; the explorer wallet page helps you create "
"addresses and move coins when the node allows it."
msgstr ""
"Funguo zinaishi katika programu ya pochi; ukurasa wa pochi kwenye kichunguzi "
"unakusaidia kuunda anwani na kusogeza sarafu nodi inaporuhusu."

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/visual_guide.html:35
#: frontend/explorer/templates/explorer/participate.html:16
msgid "Open wallet"
msgstr "Fungua pochi"

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/visual_guide.html:48
msgid "Illustration: network nodes and value flow"
msgstr "Mchoro: nodi za mtandao na mtiririko wa thamani"

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/visual_guide.html:50
msgid "Payments"
msgstr "Malipo"

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/visual_guide.html:51
msgid ""
"Transactions propagate across the network until they are included in a block."
msgstr ""
"Miamala inaenea mtandani hadi iingizwe kwenye kizuizi."

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/visual_guide.html:63
msgid "Illustration: stacked blocks and mining motif"
msgstr "Mchoro: vitalu vilivyopangwa na mhimili wa uchimbaji"

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/visual_guide.html:66
msgid ""
"Miners assemble candidate blocks and compete to extend the chain the node "
"follows."
msgstr ""
"Wachimbaji wanakusanya vitalu vinavyoweza kuchaguliwa na kushindana "
"kuendeleza mnyororo ambao nodi inafuata."

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/visual_guide.html:78
msgid "Illustration: explorer dashboard abstraction"
msgstr "Mchoro: dashibodi ya kichunguzi kwa mtindo wa jumla"

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/visual_guide.html:81
msgid ""
"Browse blocks, transactions, and mempool state in the browser without "
"logging in."
msgstr ""
"Vinjari vitalu, miamala na hali ya kumbukumbu kwenye kivinjari bila kuingia."

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/visual_guide.html:93
msgid "Illustration: structured lines suggesting JSON API"
msgstr "Mchoro: mistari iliyopangwa inayopendekeza API ya JSON"

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/visual_guide.html:96
msgid ""
"Integrate with the same JSON routes the explorer uses for automation and "
"backends."
msgstr ""
"Unganisha na njia hizo hizo za JSON ambazo kichunguzi kinatumia kwa "
"otomatiki na mifumo ya nyuma."

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/wallet_architecture.html:7
msgid ""
"How wallet programs and wallet files fit together on UTXO-style chains like "
"Bitcoin and similar designs. The same ideas help you understand keys, "
"addresses, and what the Tancoin explorer and HTTP API expose."
msgstr ""
"Jinsi programu za pochi na faili za pochi zinavyolingana kwenye minyororo ya "
"mtindo wa UTXO kama Bitcoin na miundo sawa. Mawazo sawa hukusaidia kuelewa "
"funguo, anwani, na kile kichunguzi cha Tancoin na API ya HTTP inafichua."

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/wallet_architecture.html:11
#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/wallet_architecture.html:12
msgid "On this page"
msgstr "Katika ukurasa huu"

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/wallet_architecture.html:14
#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/wallet_architecture.html:33
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "Utangulizi"

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/wallet_architecture.html:15
#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/wallet_architecture.html:37
msgid "Wallet programs"
msgstr "Programu za Wallet"

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/wallet_architecture.html:16
#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/wallet_architecture.html:43
msgid "Full-service wallets"
msgstr "Pochi za huduma kamili"

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/wallet_architecture.html:17
#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/wallet_architecture.html:47
msgid "Signing-only wallets"
msgstr "Pochi za kusaini pekee"

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/wallet_architecture.html:18
#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/wallet_architecture.html:52
msgid "Offline wallets"
msgstr "Pochi za nje ya mtandao"

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/wallet_architecture.html:19
#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/wallet_architecture.html:57
msgid "Hardware wallets"
msgstr "Pochi za vifaa"

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/wallet_architecture.html:20
#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/wallet_architecture.html:61
msgid "Distributing-only wallets"
msgstr "Pochi za kusambaza pekee"

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/wallet_architecture.html:21
#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/wallet_architecture.html:65
msgid "Wallet files"
msgstr "Faili za Wallet"

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/wallet_architecture.html:22
#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/wallet_architecture.html:68
msgid "Private key formats"
msgstr "Miundo ya funguo za kibinafsi"

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/wallet_architecture.html:23
#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/wallet_architecture.html:71
msgid "Wallet Import Format (WIF)"
msgstr "Umbizo la Uingizaji wa Wallet (WIF)"

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/wallet_architecture.html:24
#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/wallet_architecture.html:83
msgid "Mini private key format"
msgstr "Umbizo la ufunguo mdogo wa faragha"

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/wallet_architecture.html:25
#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/wallet_architecture.html:86
msgid "Public key formats"
msgstr "Miundo muhimu ya umma"

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/wallet_architecture.html:26
#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/wallet_architecture.html:90
msgid "Hierarchical deterministic (HD) keys"
msgstr "Vifunguo vya kubainisha kihierarkia (HD)."

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/wallet_architecture.html:27
#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/wallet_architecture.html:98
msgid "Storing root seeds (BIP39)"
msgstr "Kuhifadhi mbegu za mizizi (BIP39)"

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/wallet_architecture.html:28
#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/wallet_architecture.html:102
msgid "Loose-key (JBOK) wallets"
msgstr "Pochi za ufunguo uliolegea (JBOK)."

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/wallet_architecture.html:29
#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/wallet_architecture.html:105
msgid "Tancoin reference stack"
msgstr "Mkusanyiko wa kumbukumbu wa Tancoin"

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/wallet_architecture.html:34
msgid ""
"The word wallet can mean a wallet program or a wallet file. Wallet programs "
"create public keys to receive value and use private keys to spend it. Wallet "
"files store private keys and optionally metadata about transactions for the "
"program."
msgstr ""
"Neno mkoba linaweza kumaanisha programu ya mkoba au faili ya mkoba. Programu "
"za Wallet huunda funguo za umma ili kupokea thamani na kutumia funguo za "
"kibinafsi ili kuzitumia. Faili za Wallet huhifadhi funguo za faragha na "
"metadata kwa hiari kuhusu shughuli za programu."

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/wallet_architecture.html:35
msgid ""
"This page separates programs and files and uses those words consistently."
msgstr ""
"Ukurasa huu hutenganisha programu na faili na hutumia maneno hayo mara kwa "
"mara."

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/wallet_architecture.html:38
msgid ""
"Receiving and spending native units is the essential job of wallet software, "
"but one program does not have to do both. Two programs can cooperate: one "
"distributes public information used to receive funds, and another signs "
"spends."
msgstr ""
"Kupokea na kutumia vitengo vya asili ni kazi muhimu ya programu ya pochi, "
"lakini programu moja haifai kufanya zote mbili. Programu mbili zinaweza "
"kushirikiana: moja inasambaza habari za umma zinazotumiwa kupokea pesa, na "
"ishara nyingine hutumia."

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/wallet_architecture.html:39
msgid ""
"Programs also need chain data and a path to broadcast new transactions. In "
"practice many stacks split responsibilities into three parts: a public-key "
"distribution component, a signing component, and a networked component that "
"talks to peers or to services that mirror chain state."
msgstr ""
"Vipindi pia vinahitaji data ya msururu na njia ya kutangaza shughuli mpya. "
"Kivitendo rundo nyingi hugawanya majukumu katika sehemu tatu: sehemu ya "
"usambazaji wa ufunguo wa umma, sehemu ya kutia saini, na sehemu ya mtandao "
"inayozungumza na wenzao au huduma zinazoakisi hali ya mnyororo."

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/wallet_architecture.html:40
msgid ""
"Often what is shared publicly is a hash-based address (for example P2PKH or "
"P2SH), not a raw public key; full public keys may appear only when outputs "
"are spent."
msgstr ""
"Mara nyingi kinachoshirikiwa hadharani ni anwani yenye msingi wa heshi (kwa "
"mfano P2PKH au P2SH), si ufunguo ghafi wa umma; funguo kamili za umma "
"zinaweza kuonekana tu wakati matokeo yanatumika."

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/wallet_architecture.html:41
msgid ""
"A networked program is what powers experiences like a mempool dashboard: it "
"follows unconfirmed transactions, fee levels, and confirmation depth. The "
"Tancoin explorer lists mempool and confirmed transactions over HTTP; it is "
"not a substitute for a full peer-to-peer wallet backend unless you add one."
msgstr ""
"Mpango wa mtandao ndio unaowezesha matumizi kama vile dashibodi ya mempool: "
"inafuata miamala ambayo haijathibitishwa, viwango vya ada na kina cha "
"uthibitishaji. Mgunduzi wa Tancoin anaorodhesha mempool na miamala "
"iliyothibitishwa kupitia HTTP; si mbadala wa hali kamili ya nyuma ya pochi "
"kutoka kwa rika hadi rika isipokuwa ukiongeza moja."

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/wallet_architecture.html:41
msgid "Open transactions"
msgstr "Fungua shughuli"

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/wallet_architecture.html:44
msgid ""
"A full-service wallet generates keys, derives receive addresses, tracks "
"outputs paid to those addresses, builds and signs transactions, and "
"broadcasts them. Most consumer wallets behave this way because it is simple "
"for the user."
msgstr ""
"Mkoba wa huduma kamili hutengeneza funguo, hutoa anwani za kupokea, "
"kufuatilia matokeo yanayolipwa kwa anwani hizo, hujenga na kusaini miamala, "
"na kuzitangaza. Pochi nyingi za watumiaji hufanya hivi kwa sababu ni rahisi "
"kwa mtumiaji."

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/wallet_architecture.html:45
msgid ""
"The trade-off is that private keys live on an Internet-connected device. If "
"the device is compromised, keys can be exfiltrated. Encrypting the wallet "
"file helps when the wallet is idle, but it does not stop malware that "
"captures the passphrase or memory while the wallet is open."
msgstr ""
"Ubadilishanaji ni kwamba funguo za kibinafsi zinaishi kwenye kifaa "
"kilichounganishwa kwenye mtandao. Ikiwa kifaa kimeathiriwa, funguo zinaweza "
"kuchujwa. Usimbaji wa faili ya pochi husaidia wakati pochi haijatumika, "
"lakini haizuii programu hasidi ambayo inanasa kaulisiri au kumbukumbu wakati "
"pochi imefunguliwa."

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/wallet_architecture.html:48
msgid ""
"For better security, private keys can live in a separate program in a safer "
"environment. That signing-only wallet pairs with a networked wallet that has "
"chain connectivity but not the private material needed to sign."
msgstr ""
"Kwa usalama bora, funguo za faragha zinaweza kuishi katika programu tofauti "
"katika mazingira salama. Pochi hiyo ya kusaini pekee inaoanishwa na pochi ya "
"mtandao ambayo ina muunganisho wa mnyororo lakini si nyenzo ya faragha "
"inayohitajika ili kusaini."

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/wallet_architecture.html:49
msgid ""
"Signing-only setups often use deterministic key derivation so one parent key "
"can spawn many child keys without repeated manual transfer of secrets."
msgstr ""
"Mipangilio ya kuambatisha cheti pekee mara nyingi hutumia unyambulishaji wa "
"ufunguo wa kubainisha ili ufunguo mmoja wa mzazi uweze kutoa funguo nyingi "
"za mtoto bila kuhamisha siri kwa mikono."

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/wallet_architecture.html:50
msgid ""
"Typical flow: the signing wallet creates a parent private key and gives the "
"matching extended public information to the networked wallet. The networked "
"wallet derives child receive addresses, watches the chain, and builds "
"unsigned spends. It passes unsigned transactions to the signer. After "
"optional review, the signer derives the right child private keys, signs, and "
"returns signed transactions for broadcast."
msgstr ""
"Mtiririko wa kawaida: pochi ya kutia saini huunda ufunguo wa faragha wa "
"mzazi na kutoa taarifa ya umma iliyopanuliwa inayolingana kwenye pochi ya "
"mtandao. Mkoba wa mtandao hupata anwani za kupokea watoto, hutazama msururu, "
"na kutengeneza matumizi ambayo hayajasainiwa. Hupitisha miamala ambayo "
"haijasainiwa kwa aliyetia sahihi. Baada ya ukaguzi wa hiari, mtu aliyetia "
"sahihi hupata funguo za faragha zinazofaa za mtoto, ishara na kurejesha "
"miamala iliyotiwa saini ili kutangazwa."

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/wallet_architecture.html:53
msgid ""
"Offline (cold) signing is a common pattern: one machine runs disconnected as "
"the signer; another connected machine is the watch-only networked wallet. "
"The user moves data with removable media or QR codes."
msgstr ""
"Kutia sahihi nje ya mtandao (baridi) ni mchoro wa kawaida: mashine moja "
"hukatika kama saini; mashine nyingine iliyounganishwa ni mkoba wa mtandao wa "
"saa pekee. Mtumiaji huhamisha data na midia inayoweza kutolewa au misimbo ya "
"QR."

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/wallet_architecture.html:54
msgid ""
"A careful workflow reduces the risk that malware on the online machine "
"tricks the user into signing a payment to an attacker: review outputs and "
"amounts on the offline device before signing."
msgstr ""
"Mtiririko wa kazi kwa uangalifu hupunguza hatari kwamba programu hasidi "
"kwenye mashine ya mtandaoni humlaghai mtumiaji kutia sahihi malipo kwa "
"mshambulizi: kagua matokeo na kiasi kwenye kifaa cha nje ya mtandao kabla ya "
"kusaini."

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/wallet_architecture.html:55
msgid ""
"Security improves at the cost of operational friction: you need physical "
"steps every time you spend."
msgstr ""
"Usalama huboresha kwa gharama ya msuguano wa uendeshaji: unahitaji hatua za "
"kimwili kila wakati unapotumia."

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/wallet_architecture.html:58
msgid ""
"A hardware wallet is a dedicated signer. It limits attack surface compared "
"with a general-purpose operating system and can show transaction details on "
"its own screen before signing. The networked wallet sends a proposed "
"transaction; the device signs and returns it."
msgstr ""
"Mkoba wa vifaa ni saini aliyejitolea. Huweka mipaka ya eneo la mashambulizi "
"ikilinganishwa na mfumo wa uendeshaji wa madhumuni ya jumla na inaweza "
"kuonyesha maelezo ya muamala kwenye skrini yake kabla ya kusaini. Mkoba wa "
"mtandao hutuma shughuli iliyopendekezwa; kifaa hutia saini na kuirejesha."

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/wallet_architecture.html:59
msgid ""
"You still carry a device and depend on vendor firmware quality, but day-to-"
"day use is easier than pure air-gapped file transfer for many people."
msgstr ""
"Bado unabeba kifaa na unategemea ubora wa programu dhibiti wa muuzaji, "
"lakini matumizi ya kila siku ni rahisi kuliko uhamishaji wa faili ulio na "
"pengo la hewa kwa watu wengi."

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/wallet_architecture.html:62
msgid ""
"A server that must never hold spend authority can pre-generate or "
"deterministically derive receive addresses only. Two common patterns: keep a "
"pool of unused addresses in a database and hand them out once, or derive "
"child addresses from a parent public key and track the next index so keys "
"are never reused."
msgstr ""
"Seva ambayo haipaswi kamwe kushikilia mamlaka ya matumizi inaweza kuzalisha "
"mapema au kupata anwani za kupokea pekee. Mifumo miwili ya kawaida: weka "
"kundi la anwani ambazo hazijatumika katika hifadhidata na uzipe mara moja, "
"au pata anwani za watoto kutoka kwa ufunguo wa umma wa mzazi na ufuatilie "
"faharasa inayofuata ili funguo zisitumike tena."

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/wallet_architecture.html:63
msgid ""
"HD extended public keys make the second pattern practical for e-commerce "
"style payment tracking without putting private keys on the web tier."
msgstr ""
"Funguo za umma zilizopanuliwa za HD hufanya muundo wa pili kuwa wa "
"ufuatiliaji wa malipo wa mtindo wa e-commerce bila kuweka funguo za faragha "
"kwenye kiwango cha wavuti."

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/wallet_architecture.html:66
msgid ""
"At core, a wallet file is a collection of private keys and related metadata. "
"It can live on disk or even on paper as encoded secrets."
msgstr ""
"Kwa msingi, faili ya mkoba ni mkusanyiko wa funguo za kibinafsi na metadata "
"zinazohusiana. Inaweza kuishi kwenye diski au hata kwenye karatasi kama siri "
"zilizosimbwa."

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/wallet_architecture.html:69
msgid ""
"A secp256k1 private key is a 256-bit integer in a fixed valid range for "
"ECDSA. Implementations treat it as 32 bytes with range checks, not as free-"
"form text."
msgstr ""
"Ufunguo wa faragha wa secp256k1 ni nambari kamili ya biti 256 katika masafa "
"halali ya ECDSA. Utekelezaji huichukulia kama baiti 32 kwa ukaguzi wa "
"anuwai, sio kama maandishi ya umbo lisilolipishwa."

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/wallet_architecture.html:72
msgid ""
"WIF encodes a private key in Base58Check so humans copy it with fewer "
"mistakes, similar in spirit to classic address encoding."
msgstr ""
"WIF husimba ufunguo wa faragha katika Base58Check ili wanadamu waunakili "
"bila makosa machache, sawa na usimbaji wa anwani wa kawaida."

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/wallet_architecture.html:74
msgid "Start from the raw private key bytes."
msgstr "Anza kutoka kwa baiti ghafi za vitufe vya faragha."

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/wallet_architecture.html:75
msgid "Prefix 0x80 on mainnet or 0xef on testnet."
msgstr "Kiambishi awali 0x80 kwenye mainnet au 0xef kwenye testnet."

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/wallet_architecture.html:76
msgid ""
"Append 0x01 if the key is meant for compressed public keys; omit for legacy "
"uncompressed keys."
msgstr ""
"Ongeza 0x01 ikiwa ufunguo unakusudiwa kwa funguo za umma zilizobanwa; acha "
"kwa funguo za urithi ambazo hazijabanwa."

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/wallet_architecture.html:77
msgid ""
"Hash the extended key with SHA-256, then hash that result again with SHA-256."
msgstr ""
"Hashi ufunguo uliopanuliwa kwa SHA-256, kisha rudisha matokeo hayo tena kwa "
"SHA-256."

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/wallet_architecture.html:78
msgid ""
"Take the first four bytes of the second hash as a checksum and append them."
msgstr ""
"Chukua baiti nne za kwanza za heshi ya pili kama cheki na uziambatanishe."

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/wallet_architecture.html:79
msgid "Encode the byte string with Base58Check to produce the WIF string."
msgstr "Simba mfuatano wa baiti kwa Base58Check ili kutoa mfuatano wa WIF."

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/wallet_architecture.html:81
msgid ""
"Decoding reverses the steps. The same underlying key material can map to "
"different addresses depending on compressed versus uncompressed public keys, "
"so scripts and imports must agree on format."
msgstr ""
"Kusimbua kunarudisha nyuma hatua. Nyenzo hiyo hiyo muhimu ya msingi inaweza "
"kuweka ramani kwa anwani tofauti kulingana na funguo za umma zilizobanwa "
"dhidi ya ambazo hazijabanwa, kwa hivyo hati na uagizaji lazima zikubaliane "
"juu ya umbizo."

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/wallet_architecture.html:84
msgid ""
"Mini keys encode a private key in a very short printable form for physical "
"tokens or compact QR codes. They traditionally start with the letter S. A "
"quick integrity check appends a question mark, hashes with SHA-256, and "
"requires the first byte to be 0x00. The full private key is another SHA-256 "
"of the original mini string. Implementations often forbid the character 1 "
"because it looks like the letter l."
msgstr ""
"Vifunguo vidogo husimba ufunguo wa faragha kwa njia fupi sana inayoweza "
"kuchapishwa kwa tokeni halisi au misimbo iliyounganishwa ya QR. Kawaida "
"huanza na herufi S. Ukaguzi wa haraka wa uadilifu huambatisha alama ya "
"swali, heshi yenye SHA-256, na huhitaji baiti ya kwanza kuwa 0x00. Ufunguo "
"kamili wa kibinafsi ni SHA-256 nyingine ya mfuatano mdogo wa asili. "
"Utekelezaji mara nyingi hukataza herufi 1 kwa sababu inaonekana kama herufi "
"l."

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/wallet_architecture.html:87
msgid ""
"Uncompressed secp256k1 public keys use a 0x04 prefix plus X and Y "
"coordinates. Compressed keys drop Y and use 0x02 or 0x03 plus X, with a bit "
"that disambiguates the two possible Y values. Compressed keys save space and "
"are the modern default."
msgstr ""
"Vifunguo vya umma vya secp256k1 ambavyo havijabanwa hutumia kiambishi awali "
"cha 0x04 pamoja na viwianishi vya X na Y. Vifunguo vilivyobanwa vinashusha Y "
"na kutumia 0x02 au 0x03 pamoja na X, na jambo ambalo linatofautisha thamani "
"mbili zinazowezekana za Y. Vifunguo vilivyobanwa huhifadhi nafasi na ndio "
"chaguomsingi ya kisasa."

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/wallet_architecture.html:88
msgid ""
"Older software that mixed compressed and uncompressed keys produced "
"different address hashes for the same secret; spend paths must supply the "
"matching public key form."
msgstr ""
"Programu ya zamani iliyochanganya vitufe vilivyobanwa na visivyobanwa ilitoa "
"heshi tofauti za anwani kwa siri ile ile; matumizi ya njia lazima itoe fomu "
"ya ufunguo wa umma unaolingana."

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/wallet_architecture.html:91
msgid ""
"HD wallets (BIP32 family) derive a tree of keys from one seed. ECDSA lets "
"you derive a child public key from a parent public key plus public data "
"derived from a chain code and index, without touching the parent private key—"
"this is what makes watch-only branches possible."
msgstr ""
"Pochi za HD (familia ya BIP32) hupata mti wa funguo kutoka kwa mbegu moja. "
"ECDSA hukuruhusu kupata ufunguo wa umma wa mtoto kutoka kwa ufunguo wa umma "
"wa mzazi pamoja na data ya umma inayotokana na msimbo wa mnyororo na "
"faharasa, bila kugusa ufunguo wa faragha wa mzazi—hili ndilo linalowezesha "
"matawi ya saa pekee kuwezekana."

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/wallet_architecture.html:92
msgid ""
"Derivation mixes the parent chain code, a parent key point, and a 32-bit "
"index through HMAC-SHA512. Half of the output becomes a new chain code; the "
"other half combines with the parent key to form child keys. Different "
"indices produce unrelated-looking children."
msgstr ""
"Unyambulishaji huchanganya msimbo wa msururu wa mzazi, sehemu kuu ya mzazi, "
"na faharasa ya biti-32 kupitia HMAC-SHA512. Nusu ya pato inakuwa msimbo mpya "
"wa mnyororo; nusu nyingine inachanganya na ufunguo wa mzazi kuunda funguo za "
"mtoto. Fahirisi tofauti hutoa watoto wasio na uhusiano."

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/wallet_architecture.html:93
msgid "Hardened derivation"
msgstr "Utoaji mgumu"

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/wallet_architecture.html:94
msgid ""
"Normal (non-hardened) derivation has a security caveat: if an attacker "
"learns a parent extended public key together with a parent chain code, they "
"can explore the non-hardened branch. If they also capture any descendant "
"private key, they can sometimes walk back up the tree. Hardened derivation "
"mixes the parent private key into the HMAC input so extended public keys "
"cannot derive hardened children; that breaks the attack path at the cost of "
"requiring the private parent to derive child addresses."
msgstr ""
"Utoaji wa kawaida (usio ngumu) una tahadhari ya usalama: ikiwa mshambulizi "
"atafahamu mzazi ufunguo uliopanuliwa wa umma pamoja na msimbo wa msururu wa "
"mzazi, anaweza kuchunguza tawi lisilo ngumu. Ikiwa pia watakamata ufunguo "
"wowote wa kibinafsi wa kizazi, wanaweza wakati mwingine kurudi juu ya mti. "
"Utokaji mgumu huchanganya ufunguo wa kibinafsi wa mzazi kwenye ingizo la "
"HMAC ili funguo za umma zilizopanuliwa zisipate watoto walio ngumu; ambayo "
"inavunja njia ya mashambulizi kwa gharama ya kuhitaji mzazi wa kibinafsi "
"kupata anwani za mtoto."

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/wallet_architecture.html:95
msgid ""
"Indices from 0 through 2^31 minus 1 are normal; indices from 2^31 through "
"2^32 minus 1 are hardened. Notation like m / 0' / 0 / 122' marks hardened "
"steps with a prime."
msgstr ""
"Fahirisi kutoka 0 hadi 2^31 toa 1 ni za kawaida; fahirisi kutoka 2^31 hadi "
"2^32 minus 1 ni ngumu. Nukuu kama m / 0' / 0 / 122' huashiria hatua ngumu "
"zenye msingi."

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/wallet_architecture.html:96
msgid ""
"BIP32-compliant wallets typically use hardened children directly under the "
"master private key so a leaked child cannot trivially unwind the master."
msgstr ""
"Pochi zinazotii BIP32 kwa kawaida hutumia watoto walio ngumu moja kwa moja "
"chini ya ufunguo mkuu wa faragha ili mtoto aliyevuja asiweze kufungulia "
"bwana kidogo."

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/wallet_architecture.html:99
msgid ""
"The HD seed can be backed up as 128 to 256 bits of entropy mapped to a "
"mnemonic word list. An optional passphrase mixes into the PBKDF2-based seed "
"derivation. More words mean more entropy: twelve words for 128 bits is "
"common."
msgstr ""
"Mbegu ya HD inaweza kuchelezwa kama biti 128 hadi 256 za entropy "
"zilizopangwa kwenye orodha ya maneno ya mnemonic. Kaulisiri ya hiari "
"huchanganyika katika chimbuko la mbegu lenye msingi wa PBKDF2. Maneno zaidi "
"yanamaanisha entropy zaidi: maneno kumi na mbili kwa bits 128 ni ya kawaida."

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/wallet_architecture.html:100
msgid ""
"Different wallets historically disagreed on passphrase and coin-type "
"defaults. Use one program and documented settings per seed, or verify "
"compatibility before moving seeds between products."
msgstr ""
"Wallet tofauti kihistoria hazikubaliani juu ya kaulisiri na chaguomsingi za "
"aina ya sarafu. Tumia programu moja na mipangilio iliyorekodiwa kwa kila "
"mbegu, au thibitisha uoanifu kabla ya kuhamisha mbegu kati ya bidhaa."

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/wallet_architecture.html:103
msgid ""
"Older clients generated independent keys from a pool (just a bunch of keys). "
"Backups had to catch every new key before use or funds could become "
"unrecoverable. HD seeds replaced that model for most new software."
msgstr ""
"Wateja wakubwa walitoa funguo huru kutoka kwa dimbwi (funguo nyingi tu). "
"Hifadhi rudufu zilibidi kunasa kila ufunguo mpya kabla ya matumizi au pesa "
"hazingeweza kurejeshwa. Mbegu za HD zilibadilisha muundo huo kwa programu "
"nyingi mpya."

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/wallet_architecture.html:106
msgid ""
"The bundled wallet UI and JSON API help you create keys, see balances, and "
"submit signed transfers against the reference node. Operational hardening—"
"where files live, DEBUG routes, CSRF policy, and production checklist—is "
"covered on the security page."
msgstr ""
"UI ya pochi iliyounganishwa na API ya JSON hukusaidia kuunda funguo, kuona "
"salio, na kuwasilisha uhamisho uliotiwa sahihi dhidi ya nodi ya marejeleo. "
"Ugumu wa kiutendaji—ambapo faili zinaishi, njia za DEBUG, sera ya CSRF, na "
"orodha ya ukaguzi ya uzalishaji—hujumuishwa kwenye ukurasa wa usalama."

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/wallet_architecture.html:107
msgid "Wallets and security (operations)"
msgstr "Pochi na usalama (operesheni)"

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/wallet_architecture.html:107
msgid "Open the wallet app"
msgstr "Fungua programu ya mkoba"

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/wallets_security.html:7
msgid ""
"A wallet is a key pair. The address is safe to share. The WIF is a secret "
"that can spend everything. Protect it like a password."
msgstr ""
"Mkoba ni jozi muhimu. Anwani ni salama kushirikiwa. WIF ni siri ambayo "
"inaweza kutumia kila kitu. Ilinde kama nenosiri."

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/wallets_security.html:11
msgid ""
"For how wallet programs split signing, networking, and key distribution—and "
"for HD and BIP39 concepts—see the architecture guide."
msgstr ""
"Kwa jinsi programu za pochi zinavyogawa saini, mtandao, na usambazaji wa "
"funguo—pamoja na dhana za HD na BIP39—tazama mwongozo wa muundo."

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/wallets_security.html:13
msgid "Protecting secrets"
msgstr "Kulinda siri"

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/wallets_security.html:15
msgid "Never store WIF in git, screenshots, or chat."
msgstr "Usiwahi kuhifadhi WIF kwenye git, picha za skrini au gumzo."

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/wallets_security.html:16
msgid "Use environment variables or a secrets manager in production."
msgstr "Tumia vigezo vya mazingira au msimamizi wa siri katika uzalishaji."

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/wallets_security.html:17
msgid "If a key leaks, move funds to a new address with a new key."
msgstr ""
"Ufunguo ukivuja, hamishia pesa kwenye anwani mpya kwa kutumia ufunguo mpya."

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/wallets_security.html:20
msgid "Genesis wallet"
msgstr "Mkoba wa Mwanzo"

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/wallets_security.html:21
msgid ""
"On first start the node writes data/genesis_wallet.json. The /api/dev/"
"genesis-wallet/ route only works when DEBUG is True. Turn DEBUG off in "
"production and block that route."
msgstr ""
"Kwa kuanza kwanza nodi huandika data/genesis_wallet.json. Njia ya /api/dev/"
"genesis-wallet/ inafanya kazi tu wakati DEBUG ni Kweli. Zima DEBUG katika "
"toleo la umma na uzuie njia hiyo."

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/wallets_security.html:22
msgid ""
"The genesis wallet receives the first large reward. Treat it as a mint key "
"with very high privilege."
msgstr ""
"Mkoba wa genesis hupokea tuzo kubwa ya kwanza. Ichukue kama ufunguo wa mint "
"kwa upendeleo wa juu sana."

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/wallets_security.html:24
msgid "CSRF and browser clients"
msgstr "CSRF na wateja wa kivinjari"

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/wallets_security.html:25
msgid ""
"Some JSON POST routes skip CSRF so command-line tools work. Browser apps "
"that talk to the same routes should use CSRF tokens or send writes through "
"your own backend."
msgstr ""
"Baadhi ya njia za JSON POST huruka CSRF ili zana za mstari wa amri zifanye "
"kazi. Programu za kivinjari zinazozungumza na njia sawa zinapaswa kutumia "
"tokeni za CSRF au kutuma maandishi kupitia mazingira yako ya nyuma."

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/wallets_security.html:27
msgid "Network"
msgstr "Mtandao"

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/wallets_security.html:28
msgid ""
"Use HTTPS in production, set ALLOWED_HOSTS correctly, and put the node "
"behind a proxy with rate limits. This build has no peer-to-peer layer."
msgstr ""
"Tumia HTTPS katika toleo la umma, weka ALLOWED_HOSTS kwa usahihi, na uweke "
"nodi nyuma ya seva mbadala iliyo na viwango vya viwango. Muundo huu hauna "
"safu ya rika-kwa-rika."

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/wallets_security.html:30
msgid "Checklist"
msgstr "Orodha ya ukaguzi"

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/wallets_security.html:32
msgid "DEBUG off, strong SECRET_KEY, real database if you add accounts."
msgstr ""
"DEBUG imezimwa, SECRET_KEY thabiti, hifadhidata halisi ukiongeza akaunti."

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/wallets_security.html:33
msgid "Encrypt backups of TANCOIN_DATA_DIR."
msgstr "Simba nakala rudufu za TANCOIN_DATA_DIR."

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/wallets_security.html:34
msgid "Watch /api/chain/mine/ for abuse."
msgstr "Tazama /api/chain/mine/ kwa matumizi mabaya."

#: frontend/documentation/templates/documentation/wallets_security.html:35
msgid "Scale reads separately if the explorer grows."
msgstr "Mizani inasoma kando ikiwa mgunduzi anakua."

