#: frontend/explorer/templates/explorer/mempool.html:58
msgid "To mine a block: open the wallet, sign in, then use the Miner tab."
msgstr ""
"Ili kuchimba kizuizi: fungua mkoba, ingia, kisha tumia tab ya Mchimbaji."

#: frontend/explorer/templates/explorer/participate.html:7
msgid "Send TAN, mine blocks, manage your wallet"
msgstr "Tuma TAN, vizuizi vya mgodi, dhibiti mkoba wako"

#: frontend/explorer/templates/explorer/participate.html:9
msgid ""
"This chain uses UTXO, like Bitcoin: you spend whole coins and receive "
"change. There is no bank screen built in. You can use the wallet page, the "
"JSON API, or Python to sign and send. Mining is started by hand on this demo "
"node."
msgstr ""
"Msururu huu hutumia UTXO, kama Bitcoin: unatumia sarafu nzima na kupokea "
"mabadiliko. Hakuna skrini ya benki iliyojengwa ndani. Unaweza kutumia "
"ukurasa wa pochi, API ya JSON, au Python kusaini na kutuma. Uchimbaji madini "
"huanzishwa kwa mkono kwenye nodi hii ya onyesho."

#: frontend/explorer/templates/explorer/participate.html:15
msgid "Graphical wallet"
msgstr "Mkoba wa picha"

#: frontend/explorer/templates/explorer/participate.html:16
msgid ""
"Open the wallet page to create keys, check balance, send TAN, and use the "
"test faucet when debug mode is on."
msgstr ""
"Fungua ukurasa wa mkoba ili kuunda funguo, kuangalia salio, kutuma TAN, na "
"kutumia bomba la majaribio wakati hali ya utatuzi imewashwa."

#: frontend/explorer/templates/explorer/participate.html:20
msgid "Roles in one sentence"
msgstr "Wajibu katika sentensi moja"

#: frontend/explorer/templates/explorer/participate.html:22
msgid ""
"User: holds keys, builds a signed transaction that spends UTXOs and pays a "
"receiver plus a fee to miners."
msgstr ""
"Mtumiaji: hushikilia funguo, hutengeneza muamala uliotiwa saini ambao "
"hutumia UTXO na hulipa mpokeaji pamoja na ada kwa wachimbaji."

#: frontend/explorer/templates/explorer/participate.html:23
msgid ""
"Miner: collects mempool transactions, builds a block, finds proof of work, "
"publishes the block, and collects the coinbase reward and fees."
msgstr ""
"Mchimbaji: hukusanya miamala ya mempool, hutengeneza kizuizi, hupata "
"uthibitisho wa kazi, huchapisha kizuizi, na kukusanya malipo na ada za "
"coinbase."

#: frontend/explorer/templates/explorer/participate.html:24
msgid ""
"Everyone: can read the public explorer at the home, transactions, and "
"address pages."
msgstr ""
"Kila mtu: anaweza kusoma kivumbuzi cha umma nyumbani, miamala, na kurasa za "
"anwani."

#: frontend/explorer/templates/explorer/participate.html:29
msgid "Create or load a wallet"
msgstr "Unda au pakia mkoba"

#: frontend/explorer/templates/explorer/participate.html:30
msgid ""
"A wallet is a private key stored as WIF and a Base58 address you share to "
"receive funds."
msgstr ""
"Pochi ni ufunguo wa faragha uliohifadhiwa kama WIF na anwani ya Base58 "
"unayoshiriki ili kupokea pesa."

#: frontend/explorer/templates/explorer/participate.html:32
msgid ""
"Store address and WIF in a password manager. Anyone with the WIF can spend "
"your coins."
msgstr ""
"Hifadhi anwani na WIF katika kidhibiti cha nenosiri. Mtu yeyote aliye na WIF "
"anaweza kutumia sarafu zako."

#: frontend/explorer/templates/explorer/participate.html:33
msgid "Full payments guide"
msgstr "Mwongozo kamili wa malipo"

#: frontend/explorer/templates/explorer/participate.html:37
msgid "Make a payment"
msgstr "Fanya malipo"

#: frontend/explorer/templates/explorer/participate.html:39
msgid "List spendable outputs with GET /api/chain/utxo/your_address/"
msgstr ""
"Orodhesha matokeo yanayoweza kutumika na GET /api/chain/utxo/your_address/"

#: frontend/explorer/templates/explorer/participate.html:40
msgid "Pick inputs that cover amount plus fee. Values use satoshis."
msgstr ""
"Chagua pembejeo zinazofunika kiasi pamoja na ada. Maadili hutumia satoshis."

#: frontend/explorer/templates/explorer/participate.html:41
msgid ""
"Sign with Python Chain.create_transfer and Wallet, then POST /api/chain/tx/"
"submit/."
msgstr ""
"Ingia kwa kutumia Python Chain.create_transfer na Wallet, kisha POST /api/"
"chain/tx/submit/."

#: frontend/explorer/templates/explorer/participate.html:42
msgid "Wait for a miner or mine yourself."
msgstr "Subiri mchimba madini au mgodi mwenyewe."

#: frontend/explorer/templates/explorer/participate.html:44
msgid "Detailed walkthrough"
msgstr "Mwelekeo wa kina"

#: frontend/explorer/templates/explorer/participate.html:48
msgid "Act as a miner"
msgstr "Fanya kama mchimbaji madini"

#: frontend/explorer/templates/explorer/participate.html:49
msgid ""
"Mining builds the next block from the mempool and runs proof of work. Fees "
"go to the miner_wif you send, or to the genesis wallet if you omit the body."
msgstr ""
"Uchimbaji madini huunda kizuizi kinachofuata kutoka kwa kumbukumbu na "
"huendesha uthibitisho wa kazi. Ada huenda kwa mchimbaji_wiki unatuma, au kwa "
"pochi ya genesis ikiwa utaacha mwili."

#: frontend/explorer/templates/explorer/participate.html:53
msgid "More on mining"
msgstr "Zaidi juu ya madini"

#: frontend/explorer/templates/explorer/participate.html:58
msgid "Full guide"
msgstr "Mwongozo kamili"

#: frontend/explorer/templates/explorer/participate.html:59
msgid "Payments, mining, wallet lifecycle, and security."
msgstr "Malipo, uchimbaji madini, mzunguko wa maisha wa pochi, na usalama."

#: frontend/explorer/templates/explorer/participate.html:62
msgid "API cheat sheet"
msgstr "Karatasi ya kudanganya ya API"

#: frontend/explorer/templates/explorer/participate.html:63
